 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQ7o0SOA_scQ7kNvwH4vYcQ&_nc_oc=Adr3Xjyc9QiBvxOx2zvo3rOZEBjd-DARYq79ZSLmC0hjKXIxIANVgCWd6pZKW4tAZeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKbhyTpHbfcJtA1Z7KLY92ElLnPTQegYhCUyi2YfgdVxA&oe=6AA81041"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G7VLCJz5OQQQ7kNvwH6TbRZ&_nc_oc=AdrzCAFk-uuCGByHyuor2CgHZzT_dO81nXusqiXYNOK0ZFS5kCAGeNZ7nh6AHsTpSpk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4nfny5Vv_zpOxaapzheWnjBsGlBYPAtUHP7XU_qpZ_g&oe=6AA7E566"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zB6kfuF-GRYQ7kNvwGmO7gs&_nc_oc=AdpvyaiJlbTfNzzSCJRKg5eYhe6rP3OY3X9is7_kQoQ_qTVl3E-VKGni-O1CPJiE9z0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKTOagzEgKotU6dOtWv-kfdSpK-ddmeMNxe0g-k77vCBg&oe=6AA7EF5C"}, {"fil